# Day 28 – Hospital Admission Readiness Simulator

## Objective
Built an interactive Hospital Admission Readiness Simulator using HTML, Tailwind CSS and Vanilla JavaScript.

## Features
- Provider & Physician Information
- Patient Admission Workflow
- Prior Authorization Management
- Documentation Validation
- Insurance Verification
- Bed Availability Check
- Clinical Readiness Analysis
- Governance Snapshot
- Admission Readiness Score
- Final Admission Decision

## Learnings
- Hospital admission workflow
- Prior Authorization process
- Healthcare operations
- Risk reduction
- Interactive workflow simulation
